#. Description of the theme
msgid ""
"A multipurpose WordPress theme designed for directories, classifieds, and "
"marketplaces. By default, it's a lightweight yet customizable blog theme "
"that allows changing colors, fonts, and backgrounds to match your brand. "
"Paired with the HivePress plugin, it can be used to build any type of "
"directory or listing website — from business directories and job boards to "
"real estate, classifieds, and service marketplaces. There are no niche "
"limitations for listing-based websites, so whether it’s a car dealership, "
"member or staff directory, store locator, event or restaurant guide, "
"neighborhood directory, or basically any website based on posting and "
"searching listings — ListingHive is a solid choice."
msgstr ""

